Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 19:40:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] RISC OS: games library window

Folders scanned for games (each listed once), played games added,
recently played at the top; covers (JPEG, SpriteExtend), region and
serial from SYSTEM.CNF, last played, save states; per-game settings
layered over Choices when a game starts.
